 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Agent form tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up pages expose `sign-in` and `sign-up` through the
+[WebMCP Declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api).
+Each tool accepts required `username` and `password` fields. The forms keep the
+user's submit step (no `toolautosubmit`) and return a success or error message to
+the agent after the existing API request completes. Credentials and login tokens
+are not included in successful tool results.
+
+Use a browser with declarative WebMCP enabled to discover these tools on their
+respective pages. Browsers without support ignore the tool attributes and retain
+the normal form behavior.
